@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5080
@customer = demo-customer

### Seeded VYG-1001 has three units remaining
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/voyages/VYG-1001/capacity-holds
X-Customer-Id: {{customer}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-create-9001
Content-Type: application/json

{"bookingId":"BKG-9001","quantity":2}

### Replace holdId with the returned UUID; repeat with the same key to see stable replay
@holdId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/capacity-holds/{{holdId}}/confirm
X-Customer-Id: {{customer}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-confirm-9001

### Inspect current effective hold state
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/capacity-holds/{{holdId}}
X-Customer-Id: {{customer}}

### Cancelling a consumed hold is rejected and does not release confirmed capacity
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/capacity-holds/{{holdId}}
X-Customer-Id: {{customer}}

### Database and migration readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
